package Anthropic.v1
    /// Anthropic: the app's models asked through Anthropic's Claude API, as the `ai` capability: typed answers and streamed answers. Anthropic has no embeddings endpoint, so it doesn't embed.
    file package.jadpo
    kind provider
    version 1.0.0
    licence apache_2_0
    jadpo 1.0

provider
    /// Anthropic's Claude API, each request carrying the workspace's API key in `x-api-key` and the API's version in `anthropic-version`. The connection gives its address, `https://api.anthropic.com`, in `host:`.
